{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XGvaekCiVjcRLc9Zbftxjn","type":"tool_result","content":"61dc6616 Revert \"perf: batch Round 0 coset-parallel kernel launches\"\n74134b4e perf: batch Round 0 coset-parallel kernel launches\n6fccffce perf: batch degenerate stacked reduction kernel launches\n4ca1c5fa perf(cuda): add VPMM prewarm utility + batched Round 0 zerocheck + logup rules caching\n4dec564d feat(cuda): add batched Round 0 zerocheck evaluation\ne728b55f perf(cuda): batch degenerate stacked reduction kernels + 8 Round 0 threads\n8e437d1c Batch GKR input evaluation across AIRs to reduce kernel launch overhead\n077a8040 Fix FracExt output parsing in lockstep logup batched path\n6fa87df2 Add batched lockstep round-0 kernels for large traces\nece9079d Remove unnecessary current_stream_sync() in GKR input batching\nb3f1e933 Lower SR_MLE_BATCH_THRESHOLD from 512 to 64\n5acab4a3 Add batched stacked reduction MLE round kernels\n90ebfad5 Add batched GKR input evaluation kernel and integration\nb213d2b2 Add Rust batch builder and integration for logup round 0\n953477d2 Add batched logup round 0 kernel and Rust FFI\n514d9d09 Batch GKR input evaluation across AIRs to reduce kernel launch overhead\na172f597 Fix batched kernel for v2-powdr-07-04 NttEvalContext API\n077cedbc Fix FxHashMap type and unused import in batch builder\n5cb0cb59 Integrate batched zerocheck round 0 into prover loop (Phase 4)\ne1bb784d Add Rust batch builder for round-0 zerocheck (Phase 3)\nd2c89807 Add batched zerocheck round 0 kernel and Rust FFI (Phase 1-2)\n563bf371 feat(cuda): pre-whir batching Proof-of-Work grinding\n6d058df9 perf(round0): low MAX_THREADS to 128 to increase block residency (#488)\n88efce15 perf: factorization prover optimization for stacked reduction round0 (#487)\nf49ea0b7 perf: skip NTT for identity coset in logup round0 (#447)\n19b0ed94 feat: lockstep coset ntt (#438)\nd394e440 perf: use ntt instead of barycentric evaluation in logup+zeroche