to row-major for polynomial IDFT: `[skip_domain][num_cosets]`\n\n**Intermediate Buffers:**\n- Local buffers (when `GLOBAL=false`): `[BUFFER_THRESHOLD * NUM_COSETS]` per thread\n- Global buffers: `[buffer_size][total_threads][NUM_COSETS]` per thread\n\n**Shared Memory Layout:**\n- `FpExt[blockDim.x]` for reduction\n- `Fp[blockDim.x]` for NTT buffers (when `NEEDS_SHMEM=true`)\n\n### 10. **Code Path Summary**\n\n```\nsumcheck_uni_round0_polys()\n  ├─ Phase 1: Kernel Launch\n  │  ├─ For each AIR:\n  │  │  ├─ evaluate_round0_constraints_gpu()\n  │  │  │  └─ zerocheck_ntt_eval_constraints()  [FFI wrapper]\n  │  │  │     └─ _zerocheck_ntt_eval_constraints()  [CUDA entry]\n  │  │  │        ├─ Dispatch on (num_x*skip_domain < 32768)\n  │  │  │        ├─ coset_parallel: launch_zerocheck_coset_parallel()\n  │  │  │        │  └─ zerocheck_ntt_evaluate_constraints_coset_parallel_kernel<GLOBAL,NEEDS_SHMEM>\n  │  │  │        └─ lockstep: dispatch_zerocheck()\n  │  │  │           └─ zerocheck_ntt_evaluate_constraints_kernel<NUM_COSETS,GLOBAL,NEEDS_SHMEM>\n  │  │  │\n  │  │  └─ evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu()\n  │  │     └─ logup_bary_eval_interactions_round0()  [FFI wrapper]\n  │  │        └─ _logup_bary_eval_interactions_round0()  [CUDA entry]\n  │  │           ├─ Dispatch on (num_x*skip_domain < 32768)\n  │  │           ├─ coset_parallel: launch_logup_coset_parallel()\n  │  │           │  └─ logup_r0_ntt_eval_interactions_coset_parallel_kernel<GLOBAL,NEEDS_SHMEM>\n  │  │           └─ lockstep: dispatch_logup()\n  │  │              └─ logup_r0_ntt_eval_interactions_kernel<NUM_COSETS,GLOBAL,NEEDS_SHMEM>\n  │  │\n  │  └─ Store results in pending[] buffers\n  │\n  ├─ current_stream_sync()  [Block until all kernels complete]\n  │\n  └─ Phase 2: D2H Transfer & CPU Polynomial Construction\n     └─ For each pending result:\n        ├─ Transfer GPU buffer to host\n        ├─ Reconstruct polynomial via IDFT from coset evals\n        └─ Apply constraint quotient: sp_0 = (Z^{2^l_skip} - 1) * q\n```\n\n### 11. **Key Files Summary**\n\n| File | Purpose | Key Functions |\n|------|---------|---|\n| `/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/round0.rs` | Round 0 CPU/GPU interface | `evaluate_round0_constraints_gpu()`, `evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu()` |\n| `/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs` | Logup/zerocheck orchestration | `sumcheck_uni_round0_polys()` (lines 599-928) |\n| `/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/zerocheck_round0.cu` | Zerocheck kernels | Lockstep kernel (148-312), coset-parallel kernel (335-467), launchers (523-729) |\n| `/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/logup_round0.cu` | Logup kernels | Lockstep kernel (161-317), coset-parallel kernel (323-460), launchers (517-810) |\n| `/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs` | FFI wrappers | `zerocheck_ntt_eval_constraints()` (924-967), `logup_bary_eval_interactions_round0()` (977-1020) |\n\nThis implementation achieves efficient Round 0 evaluation through:\n1. **Threshold-based kernel dispatch** (coset-parallel for small workloads)\n2. **Two-phase GPU execution** (async kernel launch + D2H transfer)\n3. **Shared evaluation infrastructure** (common DAG traversal, NTT evaluation)\n4. **Per-AIR customization** (local constraint degree, height, weights)"}],"totalDurationMs":95716,"totalTokens":82300,"totalToolUseCount":33,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4632,"cache_read_input_tokens":73239,"output_tokens":4429,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4632},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":4429,"cache_read_input_tokens":73239,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4632,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4632,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":13,"searchCount":4,"bashCount":16,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
