{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NwJKQq7tZHCAE9vgzca4eM","type":"tool_result","content":"276\tsub-batch. Reuse across sub-batches with `fill_zero()` between launches. This avoids\n277\trepeated `DeviceBuffer::with_capacity` calls. Cost: one `fill_zero()` per sub-batch (~0.1ms).\n278\t\n279\t**Phase 2 modification:** Extend the `Round0Pending` struct with batch category info:\n280\t\n281\t```rust\n282\tstruct Round0Pending<F, EF> {\n283\t    // ... existing fields ...\n284\t    zc_batch_info: Option<(BatchCategory, usize)>,  // (category, index_in_category)\n285\t    logup_batch_info: Option<(BatchCategory, usize)>,\n286\t}\n287\t\n288\tenum BatchCategory { GlobalTrue, GlobalFalse }\n289\t```\n290\t\n291\tIn Phase 2, after `current_stream_sync()`:\n292\t1. D2H all 4 output buffers (zc_global, zc_local, logup_global, logup_local)\n293\t2. For each pending AIR, extract the correct slice based on batch_info\n294\t3. Feed into existing polynomial construction (unchanged)\n295\t\n296\t### Change 6: Keep-alive buffers\n297\t\n298\t**File:** `crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs`\n299\t\n300\tFor all batch-eligible AIRs, device buffers containing per-AIR data must remain alive until\n301\t`current_stream_sync()`:\n302\t- `d_main_parts_vec` — already handled in current code\n303\t- Logup per-AIR `d_rules`, `d_numer_weights`, `d_denom_weights` — keep-alive vectors as in\n304\t  74134b4e\n305\t- GLOBAL=true shared `intermediates` buffers — one per sub-batch, held in a Vec until sync"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qv3gTc3kgiTnVk6vFjTDsC","session_id":"eca100d0-d51d-440d-9172-4b67f2ccfe84","uuid":"75184b2a-a0ad-44af-97c7-6f25d673701b","timestamp":"2026-04-11T08:46:34.396Z"}
