{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NLLL9Gn8Lmjtsfi36SrCsR","type":"tool_result","content":"248\t**Sub-phase B: Form sub-batches**\n249\t\n250\tFor each of the 4 batch categories (zerocheck/logup x GLOBAL/non-GLOBAL):\n251\t\n252\t```rust\n253\tconst PER_BATCH_MEM_BUDGET: usize = 64 * 1024 * 1024; // 64 MB\n254\t\n255\tlet d = max_num_cosets * skip_domain;\n256\tlet output_elem_size = size_of::<EF>(); // or size_of::<Frac<EF>>() for logup\n257\t\n258\tlet mut sub_batches = vec![];\n259\tlet mut current_batch = vec![];\n260\tlet mut current_total_x_blocks: u32 = 0;\n261\tlet mut current_intermed_elems: usize = 0; // only for GLOBAL=true categories\n262\t\n263\tfor (idx, meta, x_blocks, intermed_elems) in eligible_airs {\n264\t    // tmp_sums_buffer: total_x_blocks * d * sizeof(output_elem)\n265\t    let projected_tmp = (current_total_x_blocks + x_blocks) as usize * d * output_elem_size;\n266\t    // intermediates: sum of per-AIR intermed_elems * sizeof(Fp) (GLOBAL=true only, 0 otherwise)\n267\t    let projected_intermed = (current_intermed_elems + intermed_elems) * size_of::<F>();\n268\t    let projected_total = projected_tmp + projected_intermed;\n269\t\n270\t    if projected_total > PER_BATCH_MEM_BUDGET && !current_batch.is_empty() {\n271\t        sub_batches.push(current_batch);\n272\t        current_batch = vec![];\n273\t        current_total_x_blocks = 0;\n274\t        current_intermed_elems = 0;\n275\t    }\n276\t    current_batch.push((idx, meta, x_blocks, intermed_elems));\n277\t    current_total_x_blocks += x_blocks;\n278\t    current_intermed_elems += intermed_elems;\n279\t}\n280\tif !current_batch.is_empty() {\n281\t    sub_batches.push(current_batch);\n282\t}\n283\t```\n284\t\n285\tThe budget includes both `tmp_sums_buffer` and `intermediates` memory. For GLOBAL=false\n286\tcategories, `intermed_elems` is always 0, so the budget degenerates to the tmp-only formula.\n287\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PYiTqpPJ12e